[13:31.32]fitness [ˈfɪtnəs]n. 适当，适合；健康 例 He will give you a fitness assessment and then come up with the work-out plan for your needs. 搭 fltness club 健身俱乐部 / fltness coach 健身 教练 / fltness test 体能测验
